# No `doi:` and no `identifiers:` entry for this software: the Zenodo deposit
# has not been made, and a placeholder DOI in machine-readable citation metadata
# is a dead identifier that harvesters would resolve (audit 2026-09-05, M-5).
# `datapackage.json` omits its `id` for the same reason and carries
# `pending_doi: true`. Both flip together once Zenodo mints one -- see
# ROADMAP.md, "Open items". The `doi:` under `preferred-citation` below is the
# published *article*'s DOI and is real.
